# Addresses the blog published between 2013 and 2019, and where each one goes now.
#
# Read by nginx (an include inside a map block in default.conf) and by scripts/preview.mjs, so the
# local preview redirects exactly like production. One list, two consumers, no drift.
#
# Keys carry no trailing slash on purpose: default.conf normalises /foo/ to /foo in the rewrite
# phase, before any of this is consulted, so a key with a slash would never match.

